Z||000012||deceler8||03-03-2000||09:14 AM||||Seems to me that a better use of the three day period would be for all Americans to check their tire pressure as the average car would probably gain 3-5% in gas mileage if tires were properly inflated.<P>So many simple things could be done by the average person at little expense to raise their fuel economy. And lower demand translates to lower prices.||||reg||10
