Z||000028||Raydar||03-13-2000||10:25 AM||||Okay. Putting on flame suit.<P>I_don't_think_it_will_do_any_good.<P>Why? As far as the oil companies are concerned, it will all average out. Everyone is going to swamp the gas stations, the day before the gas out, then they're going to swamp them again, the day after. All that's going to happen is that (maybe) the retailers will have to adjust their ordering schedule, just a bit. Many of the retailers (especially the "mom 'n' pop" operations) are just working stiffs, like the rest of us. They are not to blame for the high prices. <P>Okay. Blast away. ||||reg||1
